            <div v-else-if="slide.visual === 'applications'" class="mock-content application-mock"><div class="mock-heading"><small>投递记录</small><strong>我的机会 <em>8 个岗位</em></strong></div><div class="stage-line"><span v-for="stage in ['已投递','笔试','面试','Offer']" :key="stage">{{ stage }}</span></div><div class="application-row"><i class="company-logo">顺</i><div><b>顺丰科技</b><small>AI开发工程师 · 官网</small></div><span class="stage-pill">面试</span></div><div class="application-row"><i class="company-logo orange">字</i><div><b>字节跳动</b><small>后端开发工程师 · 内推</small></div><span class="stage-pill muted">笔试</span></div></div>
            <div v-else-if="slide.visual === 'calendar'" class="mock-content calendar-mock"><div class="mock-heading"><small>2026年10月</small><strong>本周安排</strong></div><div class="calendar-grid"><span v-for="day in ['一','二','三','四','五','六','日']" :key="day" class="weekday">{{ day }}</span><span v-for="day in 14" :key="day" :class="{ selected: day === 8, marked: [8, 9, 10].includes(day) }">{{ day }}</span></div><div class="calendar-event"><i></i><div><b>去哪儿旅行 · HR面</b><small>10月8日 · 14:50</small></div><span>面试</span></div></div>
            <div v-else-if="slide.visual === 'mail'" class="mock-content mail-mock"><div class="mock-heading"><small>招聘邮件识别</small><strong>确认识别结果</strong></div><div class="mail-paper"><div class="mail-subject">【顺丰科技】面试安排通知</div><p>你好，邀请你参加 AI 开发工程师岗位面试，请确认以下安排。</p><div class="recognized-grid"><span>公司<b>顺丰科技</b></span><span>面试轮次<b>二面</b></span><span>时间<b>10月8日 14:50</b></span><span>方式<b>视频面试</b></span></div></div><div class="mail-confirm"><span>识别完成，请核对信息</span><b>确认并加入日程　✓</b></div></div>
            <div v-else-if="slide.visual === 'stats'" class="mock-content stats-mock"><div class="mock-heading"><small>求职分析</small><strong>投递进度一览</strong></div><div class="stat-cards"><div><small>累计投递</small><b>24 <i>份</i></b></div><div><small>面试机会</small><b>08 <i>场</i></b></div><div><small>Offer</small><b>02 <i>个</i></b></div></div><div class="chart-title">各阶段机会分布</div><div class="bar-chart"><span v-for="(height, barIndex) in [45, 74, 55, 88, 34, 62, 48, 77, 59, 92, 43, 68]" :key="barIndex" :style="{ height: `${height}%` }"></span></div><div class="chart-labels"><small>已投递</small><small>笔试</small><small>面试</small><small>Offer</small></div></div>
