            <div v-else class="mock-content team-mock"><div class="mock-heading"><small>协作小组</small><strong>一起跟进求职进展</strong></div><div class="team-members"><span class="avatar lavender">周</span><span class="avatar aqua">林</span><span class="avatar amber">陈</span><div><b>求职小组</b><small>3 位成员 · 本周 6 项日程</small></div></div><div class="team-activity"><small>小组动态</small><p><i class="activity-dot"></i><span><b>林同学</b> 更新了面试安排<small>今天 10:32 · 星河科技一面</small></span></p><p><i class="activity-dot green"></i><span><b>你</b> 完成了本周日程<small>昨天 19:10 · 共 4 项</small></span></p></div><div class="team-footer"><span>投递进度</span><b>成员间同步更新　→</b></div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="art-caption"><span>CAREERFLOW GUIDE</span><span>{{ String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0') }} / {{ String(slides.length).padStart(2, '0') }}</span></div>
        </section>
      </article>
    </Transition>
  </div>
</template>

